0..60 Comment "// A typed evaluator as it should read, and what refuses it."
61..63 Comment "//"
64..143 Comment "// Each expression\'s index is the object type it evaluates to, and its value is"
144..220 Comment "// the meaning of that index. A case on an expression binds each arm\'s index"
221..298 Comment "// equation and does not refine by it. So an arm\'s goal keeps the scrutinee\'s"
299..319 Comment "// index as written."
320..322 Comment "//"
323..394 Comment "// The checker refuses each declaration below by the name its attribute"
395..473 Comment "// states. Each turns to `checks` as its rung lands, and the source then moves"
474..495 Comment "// to the model root."
496..498 Comment "//"
499..574 Comment "// - see: #3483 — not implemented: refinement by solution, for `eval` and"
575..589 Comment "//   `evalInt`"
590..645 Comment "// - see: #3481 — the spike that wrote these programs"
